+ * weights (each position's sum 2^14) and 2 fractional bits between the passes, the planes' edges
+ * repeated: every GPU gets the same bytes. Only scaling up or not at all on each axis (a filter that
+ * scales down would have to be widened); the converted transport draws the rest.
