+ * 0.266 and 0.382 against 0.312, three of a profile 7 stream without its layer (YCbCr) 0.199
+ * against 0.150, 0.667 against 0.661 and 0.699 against 0.691; the median lower in all six; the 99th
+ * percentile from 1.5 % above (the chart's edges) to 0.7 % below. The same with renditions made by
